the Holocene, has ended.</i>


00:02:20.524 --> 00:02:22.458
<i>After nine years of research,</i>


00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:25.594
<i>the evidence shows that
we have left the Holocene</i>


00:02:25.596 --> 00:02:28.400
<i>and entered the Anthropocene epoch,</i>


00:02:30.635 --> 00:02:34.237
<i>because humans now change
the Earth and its systems</i>


00:02:34.239 --> 00:02:37.777
<i>more than all natural
processes combined.</i>


00:02:57.495 --> 00:03:02.066
Six, seven,
eight... nine.


