of the African elephant.</i>


01:18:07.000 --> 01:18:11.470
<i>A new generation of poachers,
armed with new weapons</i>


01:18:11.472 --> 01:18:16.141
<i>connected to vast new markets
across the world,</i>


01:18:16.143 --> 01:18:18.112
<i>threatens to exterminate them.</i>


01:18:22.015 --> 01:18:26.753
<i>In destroying the ivory,
we reject once and for all,</i>


01:18:26.755 --> 01:18:32.527
<i>those who think that our natural
heritage can be sold for money.</i>


01:18:34.094 --> 01:18:36.660
<i>Before you,
ladies and gentlemen,</i>


01:18:36.662 --> 01:18:38.596
<i>the largest haul of ivory</i>


01:18:38.598 --> 01:18:42.234
<i>ever to be destroyed
in this manner.</i>


01:18:42.236 --> 01:18:45.236
<i>Poaching and trafficking
in wildlife,</i>


01:18:45.238 --> 01:18:48.140
<i>is now a branch
of international crime.</i>


01:18:48.142 --> 01:18:54.679
<i>The fight against it will be won by
alliances across nations and continents.</i>


01:18:54.681 --> 01:18:57.481
<i>The principle is clear enough:</i>


01:18:57.483 --> 01:19:00.686
<i>Ivory belongs to our elephants.</i>


01:19:11.331 --> 01:19:18.737
Kenya has decided that ivory
is an evil commodity.


01:19:18.738 --> 01:19:25.545
But Kenya's decision has to be
backed by a global decision.


01:19:28.415 --> 01:19:31.816
<i>Let's kill this trade.</i>


01:19:31.818 --> 01:19:35.153
<i>The opposite is unimaginable.</i>


01:20:24.237 --> 01:20:29.240
<i>The Earth is
4.5 billion years old,</i>


01:20:29.242 --> 01:20:32.179
<i>and its history can be read
in the rocks.</i>


01:21:01.340 --> 01:21:07.779
<i>Modern human civilization has
developed within just 10,000 years,</i>


01:21:07.781 --> 01:21:11.682
<i>yet our success as a species
has tipped the planet's systems</i>


01:21:11.684 --> 01:21:13.821
<i>outside their natural limits.</i>


01:21:15.789 --> 01:21:17.622
<i>We are all implicated,</i>


01:21:17.624 --> 01:21:20.661
<i>some far more profoundly
than others.</i>


01:21:23.263 --> 01:21:27.199
<i>But the tenacity and ingenuity
that helped us thrive,</i>


01:21:27.201 --> 01:21:30.267
<i>can also help us to pull
these systems back</i>


01:21:30.269 --> 01:21:32.874
<i>to a safe place for all
life on Earth.</i>


01:21:36.510 --> 01:21:40.515
<i>Recognizing and reimagining
our dominant signal...</i>


01:21:42.749 --> 01:21:44.684
<i>is the beginning of change.</i>

